-- Security Passport — the 2026-10-03 certification research import (DATA).
--
-- GENERATED by scripts/passport-catalogue-research-build.ts from
-- docs/passport/research/2026-10-03-certification-catalogue/catalogue.json and the reviewed decisions in
-- scripts/lib/passport-catalogue-research-data.ts. Do not edit by hand:
-- scripts/passport-catalogue-research-check.ts fails when this file differs
-- from what the generator produces.
--
-- Depends on 20270212090000_sp_catalogue_research_foundation.sql.
--
-- ══ WHAT THIS MIGRATION DOES ═════════════════════════════════════════
--
--   * records all 170 research records, each with an explicit outcome
--       14 matched to an existing definition (nothing changes)
--       140 added as approved definitions, INACTIVE (is_active = false)
--       16 retained for review, each with its unresolved issue and action
--       0 excluded
--   * adds 31 certification issuers and their aliases (the awarding organisation; never ISO
--     itself, never a training provider);
--   * adds 140 definitions to the EXISTING tables (sp_credential_types,
--     sp_certification_definitions, sp_credential_definition_reviews,
--     sp_credential_definition_metadata, sp_certification_sources). There is no
--     second catalogue.
--
-- ══ WHAT IT DELIBERATELY DOES NOT DO ═════════════════════════════════
--
--   * It activates nothing. Every new definition is is_active = false, so no
--     holder can select one and the approved catalogue view is unchanged.
--     Publication is 20270214090000_sp_catalogue_research_publish.sql, which
--     is released only after the application that renders these kinds.
--   * It touches no existing definition, issuer, claim, market pack or grant.
--   * research_scope and jurisdiction_context stay verbatim research metadata.
--     No definition gets a jurisdiction, a market pack, a sub-jurisdiction, an
--     authority or a regulated role: scope_code is global_professional for all
--     of them, which the database already forbids from carrying any of those.
--   * legal_review_state is 'pending': no legal or expert review took place.
--   * allows_no_expiry stays false and every maintenance policy is
--     'not_assessed': unknown renewal is never lifetime validity.
--   * verification_mode is 'none' for every new issuer: the research does not
--     establish a public holder lookup, and nothing here verifies a holder.

